## Project Structure

- [src/tiny_llm/train.py](/home/subbu/Code/try-llm/tiny-llm/src/tiny_llm/train.py): training pipeline
- [src/tiny_llm/generate.py](/home/subbu/Code/try-llm/tiny-llm/src/tiny_llm/generate.py): inference script
- [src/tiny_llm/model.py](/home/subbu/Code/try-llm/tiny-llm/src/tiny_llm/model.py): Transformer model implementation
- [src/tiny_llm/data.py](/home/subbu/Code/try-llm/tiny-llm/src/tiny_llm/data.py): dataset + tokenizer + batching
- [src/tiny_llm/api.py](/home/subbu/Code/try-llm/tiny-llm/src/tiny_llm/api.py): FastAPI-based inference server
- [configs/default.yaml](/home/subbu/Code/try-llm/tiny-llm/configs/default.yaml): experiment configuration
- [docs/](/home/subbu/Code/try-llm/tiny-llm/docs): conceptual docs and UML diagrams

