## Notes for Further Training

- Increase `data.max_samples` to train on more text.
- Increase `model.n_layer`, `model.n_embd`, and `model.block_size` carefully.
- Keep `val_ratio` non-zero to detect overfitting.
- Save multiple checkpoints and compare generations.
